  "keyFeatures": [
    "Zero dependencies — uses only Node.js built-in modules (http, net, crypto, tls)",
    "Dual-protocol: WebSocket (RFC 6455) and custom binary TCP on separate ports",
    "Token-bucket rate limiting with per-client and per-event overrides",
    "Room-based pub/sub with automatic cleanup",
    "ACK (request-response) system built over the real-time protocol",
    "Graceful shutdown with SIGINT/SIGTERM handling",
    "Health check HTTP endpoint compatible with Kubernetes and Docker",
    "TLS/SSL support for both wss:// and TCP",
    "Extensible via custom rate limiter, IP tracker, and client ID generator interfaces",
    "Runtime configuration updates without server restart",
    "Client-side message queue with auto-drain on reconnect",
    "Exponential backoff reconnection with configurable jitter",
    "Full TypeScript support with bundled .d.ts definitions",
    "O(1) client lookup by ID using indexed Map",
    "Hook system for server and client lifecycle events"
  ],
